{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31359","headline":"夏杪登越王楼临涪江望雪山寄朝中知友 · 于兴宗","name":"夏杪登越王楼临涪江望雪山寄朝中知友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴西西北楼，堪望亦堪愁。\n山乱江回远，川清树欲秋。\n晴明中雪岭，烟霭下渔舟。\n写寄朝天客，知余恨独游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于兴宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}